    "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, horizontal 16:9 composition, ONE single continuous shot from a completely locked-off static tripod camera, no cuts, no scene change, no camera movement, no zoom, no pan, no change of lighting. High-end beverage commercial, ultra slow motion, 1000 fps phantom camera look, crisp macro detail. Deep berry-black background with a soft magenta-pink glow behind the center, warm pink rim light, glossy highlights, faint drifting mist. The frame is half filled with a thick creamy pink strawberry protein shake, smooth and glossy like a milkshake, with tiny bubbles, rising fast. [Shot 2] At 00:02.000, the same static shot: a ribbon of white milk pours in from the top and twists into a slow spiral swirl inside the pink shake, creamy white and pink marbling. [Shot 3] At 00:05.000, the same static shot: the swirling pink shake fills almost the whole frame, rich and velvety, small bubbles rising, the surface calm at the very top edge of the frame.\n\noverall_soundscape: soft whoosh, thick creamy liquid splashes, gentle bubbling.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: none.",
